Name:Pyromancer
Desc:When the Pyromancer wakes up, they may decide to powder a player or to ignite. Igniting attacks all currently powdered players. The Pyromancer wins only when all other players are dead. In bigger games, the Host may find it challenging to remember who is powdered - they may want to note down the powdered players.
